# INT low from phase 40 to 80: taken at the end of the NOP that runs
# phases 40..47, so the INTA cycle runs phases 52..65. The NMI pulse at
# phases 52..53 falls inside it: the edge is latched, the IM1 response
# finishes (INTA and the two pushes), and the NMI is taken before the
# handler's first instruction (an NMI ack fetch at 0038, two pushes, 0066).
40  int  0
80  int  1
52  nmi  0
54  nmi  1
